    "abstract": {
      "en": "Map representing the total population of Caucasus in 2020 per NUTS2. The data comes from the national offices of statistics of each country in Caucasus : Armenia, Azerbaijan, Georgia, Iran, Russia and Turkey. Data sources : Statistical Committee of the Republic of Armenia, Statistical Committee of the Republic of Azerbaijan, National Statistics Office of Georgia, Statistical Centre of Iran, Federal State Statistics Service of Russia and Turkish Statistical Institute. To download the data please click on the following links : https://www.armstat.am/en/ https://www.stat.gov.az/ https://www.amar.org.ir/english https://data.tuik.gov.tr/ https://www.geostat.ge/en https://eng.rosstat.gov.ru/.",
